      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima twahinduka, twaimutsya orugyendo nituza omu ihamba, twatoora omuhanda ogurikuza aha Nyanja erikutukura, nk'oku MUKAMA yandagiire; twamara ebiro bingi nitwehinguririza orushozi Seiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yangira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwanya ogu mumazire nimwehinguririza oru rushozi ni muhango munonga; mukiikame mutoore aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi oragiire abantu oti: Mwaza kuraba omu nsi ya beene waanyu aba Esau, abatwire Seiri; bo baryabatiina; n'ahabw'ekyo mwerinde munonga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.10+2CH.20.11+2CH.20.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 20:10-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mutaribarwanisa; ahakuba tindibaha ha nsi yaabo, n'obu haakuba ah'okuribata ekigyere; ahabw'okuba nkaha Esau orushozi Seiri kuba orwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muryaguma mubashakyemu eby'okurya, mubone kurya, kandi mugure nabo amaizi, mubone kunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akakuha omugisha omu mirimo yoona ey'emikono yaawe, yaamanya engyendo zaawe ez'omuri eri ihamba rihango; kandi emyaka egi yoona makumi ana MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe agumire naiwe, otaine ki obuzire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tutyo twagumizamu, twayetantara beene waitu aba Esau, abatwire Seiri, twayetantara n'omuhanda ogurikuraba Araba niguruga Elaasi na Ezionigeberi; twakuba, twatoora omuhanda ogurikuza omu ihamba rya Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 19:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yangira ati: Mutarahura Abamoabu, mukabarwanisa; ahakuba tindibaha buhunguzi mu nsi yaabo, ahabw'okuba nkaha aba Looti ensi ya Aari kuba eyaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Obunyakare aba Emimu bakaba batwireyo, n'eihanga ry'amaani ery'abantu baingi kandi baraingwa nk'aba Anaki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi bakaba nibeetwa aba Reefa nk'aba Anaki; kwonka Abamoabu bakabeeta aba Emimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi obunyakare Abahoori nabo bakaba batwire Seiri, baabanyaga, baabaita, baatuura omu nsi yaabo, nk'Abaisraeli oku baakubwire ensi yaabo ei MUKAMA yaabahaire.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagaruka yaagira ati: Mbwenu mwimukye, mwambukye akagyera Zeredi. Ako kagyera Zeredi twakambuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 14:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Emyaka ei twamazire okwiha obu twaruga Kadeshi-barunea okuhitsya obu twayambukire ako kagyera Zeredi, ekahika makumi ashatu na munaana; okuhitsya obu abarwani boona ab'obusingye obwo baahwereire kimwe omu nsiisira zaitu, nk'oku MUKAMA yaabagambiire naarahira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.106.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 106:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.3.11+HEB.3.12+HEB.3.13+HEB.3.14+HEB.3.15+HEB.3.16+HEB.3.17+HEB.3.18+HEB.3.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 3:11-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.4.1+HEB.4.2+HEB.4.3+HEB.4.4+HEB.4.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Buzimazima omukono gwa MUKAMA gukabarwanisa okubahwerekyerereza omu nsiisira zaitu, okuhitsya obu baahweireho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abarwani boona ku baaherize kufa, baahwa omu bantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yangira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri izooba nimwija kuraba omuri Aari, mucwekanise omwatano gwa Moabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ku oraahikye haihi n'Abaamoni, otabarahura, n'obu kwakuba okubarwanisa; ahakuba tindikuha buhunguzi omu nsi y'Abaamoni, ahabw'okuba nkagiha aba Looti kuba eyaabo. (",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi egyo nayo neeyetwa ey'aba Reefa; obunyakare aba Reefa bakaba bagitwiremu; kwonka Abaamoni hati nibabeeta Abazamuzumi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rikaba riri eihanga ry'amaani, ery'abantu baingi kandi baraingwa nk'aba Anaki; kwonka MUKAMA akabacwekyerereza omu maisho g'Abaamoni, baabanyaga, baatuura omu nsi yaabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nk'oku yaagiriire aba Esau, abatwire Seiri, obu yaacwekyerereza aba Hoori omu maisho gaabo, bakabanyaga, bakatuura omu nsi yaabo n'okuhitsya hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'aba Avimu, abaabaire batwire omu birorero okuhika Gaaza, aba Kafutoori, abaarugire Kafutoori, bakabacwekyereza, baatuura omu nsi yaabo.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaagaruka yangira ati: Mwimukye mugyende, mwambukye oruhanga rwa Arunooni; reeba naahayo Sihooni Omuamori, omugabe wa Heshibooni, n'ensi ye omu mikono yaawe; otandikye kumurwanisa n'okukubuura ensi ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.11.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 11:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Eri izooba niinyija kwitsa amahanga agari ahansi y'eiguru obwoba n'okugatiinisa ahabwawe; nibaija kuhurira okurangaanwa kwawe, bateteme, bagire amaganya maingi ahabwawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
